  (text "Power sheet (step 3, drawn after the Stage 0b nPM1304-EK tests):\n- nPM1304 QFN32: VBUS from dock pad VIN (TVS), VBAT to cell pads through the current-measure jumper,\n  BUCK1 = 1.8 V (VSET1 resistor), BUCK2 unused (VOUT2 to VSYS, VSET2 to GND), VDDIO to VOUT1.\n- 10 k NTC on the cell to the NTC pin, JEITA hot cut-off about 45 C.\n- SHPHLD pull-up + test pad + optional button footprint. PMIC_INT to the SoC.\n- VSYS feeds the DRV2605L.\nTEMPORARY: the two PWR_FLAGs below stand in for the nPM1304 outputs so ERC passes. Remove them in step 3." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid fbbb0e99-d2f4-4c75-867b-ec914a9e4d8c))
